 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They return at evening, snarling like dogs",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Prowling around the city in the dark",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They roam about for food, unsatisfied",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And howl through the night without a rest",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the sin of their mouths, let them be caught",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In their own pride, by the lies they tell",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Consume them in wrath until they are gone",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they will know God rules over Jacob",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I will sing of your strength",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the morning I will sing aloud of your mercy",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have been my fortress",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My refuge in the day of my distress",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the ends of the earth your rule is known",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The proud are consumed in your holy wrath",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The snarling dogs circle and find no food",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their howling fades into the silence",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
